flowchart LR
  R[Receiver - pendente] -->|requested| REQ[(REQUESTED)]
  REQ --> M[Manager]
  M -->|SSOT e outbox| DB[(sum schema)]
  DB --> P[Publisher]
  P -->|desired| DES[(DESIRED)]
  DES --> REC[Reconciler - motor pendente]
  DES --> OBS[Observer - motor pendente]
  OBSV[(OBSERVED)] --> REC
  OBS -->|observed| OBSV
  REC -->|action| ACT[(ACTION)]
  ACT --> EX[Executor - processo pendente]
  EX -->|completed ou failed| RES[(RESULT)]
  RES --> REC
  RES --> OBS
  EX -->|PROJECT_GRANT_OWNER em roles-ipm| Z[Zitadel]
  OBS -->|leitura| Z
